    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p>The blast of flame sears one side of your face, boiling one eyeball in its orbit.</p><p><strong>Effects:</strong> Gain @Condition[Stunned] (3). You also lose the eye – @UUID[Compendium.wfrp4e-core.items.Item.weczkAMPlTjX7lqU]{Amputation (Hard)}. Apart from any Fellowship loss due to the lost eye you suffer an additional penalty of -10 to your Fellowship due to extensive scarring on that side of your face.</p>"
